      "id": "claim_4a84e833554d41a592f3344435863568",
      "statement": "Each workspace's Overseer DO holds a real git object database of SHA-1, zlib-deflated loose objects byte-identical to what git writes, stored one record per object in the gitObjects collection, using isomorphic-git's plumbing only.",
