    {
      "id": "claim_1ccd5bfe66e142fa862fc0d338d16e1f",
      "statement": "The git object store deliberately has no ref layer — no branches, tags, or HEAD; the refs are gadget records' commitId heads, blueprint records, and chats' pinned commits, managed by the Overseer, which lets unrelated histories coexist and related histories deduplicate at the blob/tree level.",
      "evidence": [
