    {
      "id": "claim_f3bf3886d15643829f9a75227186cf7d",
      "statement": "The git-storage migration synthesizes per-gadget commit chains from the legacy Yjs code log (commit points at historical merges, hour gaps, the final version, and pinned versions), roots every permanent gadget at an empty-tree version-0 commit, converts each live chat in place to the commit-pinned change-stream form, and is re-runnable because object writes are content-addressed and record writes happen in one synchronous tail.",
